WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
At the farm fence, a toddler points.

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:03.850
A dog.

3
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.860
Doggy!

4
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:05.780
A cow.

5
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:06.800
Doggy!

6
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:07.690
A sheep.

7
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.710
Doggy!

8
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:09.690
A horse.

9
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:10.970
Doggy again.

10
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.590
She's wrong three times out of four.

11
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.750
Or is she?

12
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.890
What is she actually getting right?

13
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:21.290
In this mission, you'll find out what kind
of word fills most of a toddler's first

14
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.250
50.

15
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.870
You'll watch children stretch a
word, and sometimes shrink one,

16
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.580
and ask why they do it.

17
00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.060
And you'll listen in on
a toddler at the park,

18
00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.600
to catch her doing it.

19
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.780
Your mission: explain
what she's doing right.
